Fix this merge helper so equal values from both sorted inputs are retained.

```csharp
public static List<int> Merge(IReadOnlyList<int> left, IReadOnlyList<int> right)
{
    var result = new List<int>();
    int i = 0, j = 0;
    while (i < left.Count && j < right.Count)
    {
        if (left[i] < right[j]) result.Add(left[i++]);
        else if (right[j] < left[i]) result.Add(right[j++]);
        else { result.Add(left[i]); i++; j++; }
    }
    result.AddRange(left.Skip(i));
    result.AddRange(right.Skip(j));
    return result;
}
```

